# 6. ⏰ 80/20 + Time

One of Koch's major applications is thinking differently about time.

Instead of asking:

> "How can I become better at managing every minute?"

Ask:

> **"Which activities deserve my best hours?"**

Suppose your day looks like:

**Morning:** high energy
**Afternoon:** moderate energy
**Night:** tired

You could allocate:

### High-energy hours

🔥 DSA / difficult coding

### Moderate-energy hours

📚 Core CS / project work

### Low-energy hours

📝 Revision / documentation / administrative tasks

The goal is to match **high-value work with high-quality attention**.

