# 12. 🐛 80/20 + Debugging

This is especially relevant to your software-development work.

Suppose your application has 50 bugs.

Don't necessarily fix them randomly.

Ask:

> Which 5 bugs are causing most of the user problems?

Then prioritize those.

This is essentially:

**80/20 debugging.**

